           two different global sets: two instances, two builds, one IntDir,
           and the tlog race MSB6003 reports. Dropping Build.0 from the
           solution (2026-09-01) stopped the race by never building the engine
           at all, which only moved the failure to Link, where the app asked
           for an MTEngineSDL.lib nothing had produced.

